## 0. ROLE & GOAL

You are a senior Android engineer. Build a complete, working, installable **Android app (debug APK)** called **RakshakAI — Your Intelligent Digital Guardian**.

RakshakAI is a **privacy-first, predictive scam-defence app** for India. Most scam apps ask *"Is this message a scam?"*. RakshakAI asks **"What does the scammer want the person to do next, what might they try after that, and how do we stop the user before harm happens?"**

Core user journey: **Understand the scam → Predict the next move → Recognise pressure → Intervene before harm → Preserve evidence & guide recovery.**

Four pillars: **DETECT** (understand messages/links/conversations) · **PREDICT** (forecast the next scam stage) · **PREVENT** (warn before risky actions/payments) · **PROTECT** (preserve evidence, keep analysis on-device).

Primary users: elderly smartphone users, regular users, digitally inexperienced users, and family members who help them. Primary market: India. Languages: **English, Hindi (Devanagari) and Hinglish**.

Work autonomously. When something is ambiguous, pick the most reasonable option, note it in `docs/DECISIONS.md`, and keep going. Compile after every phase (see §14). The final deliverable is a **buildable Gradle project + `app-debug.apk`** and a short README.

