## 5. DETECTION ENGINE — DESIGN (rule-based, explainable)

### 5.1 Pipeline (target ≤ 2 s; typically < 100 ms)
1. Validate input (max ~5,000 chars per message; show "text was truncated" if cut; never crash on empty/huge/malformed/emoji/RTL input).
2. Normalise: Unicode NFKC, lowercase, strip zero-width chars, convert Devanagari digits, collapse whitespace, map common obfuscations (`0→o`, `@→a`, `$→s`, repeated chars) **only for matching**, keep original for display/highlight offsets.
3. Language detect: Devanagari ratio → Hindi; Latin text with ≥N Hinglish marker words (`aap, aapka, karein, kijiye, turant, abhi, band, jayega, hai, ko, mat, batana, paisa, khata`) → Hinglish; else English; mixed → "Hindi-English mixed". Unsupported scripts → show **limited-analysis warning**.
4. Extract URLs (http/https/www/bare domains with suspicious TLDs, shorteners, `upi://`, phone numbers, UPI IDs, amounts such as `₹5,000`, `Rs 500`).
5. Run IntentDetector, ManipulationDetector, ScamCategoryClassifier (each returns matches with spans + weights).
6. UrlAnalyzer on every URL.
7. RiskFusionEngine → score, level, confidence, uncertainty flag.
8. ExplanationEngine + RecommendationEngine (en/hi templates built **only from detected evidence**).

### 5.2 Seed lexicon (expand each list to ≥40 phrases across en/hi/hinglish in `assets/rules/*.json`, with weights 1–5; matching must be word-boundary/phrase aware to avoid false hits)

- **Urgency:** immediately, urgent(ly), right now, today only, tonight, within 24 hours, last chance, final notice, expires, act fast / turant, abhi, jaldi, aaj hi, aaj raat, warna / तुरंत, अभी, जल्दी, आज ही, आज रात, तत्काल, वरना
- **Fear/threat:** blocked, suspended, deactivated, disconnected, freeze, legal action, arrest, FIR, case registered, penalty, SIM will be blocked / band ho jayega, block ho jayega, giraftar, jail, case darj / बंद हो जाएगा, ब्लॉक, गिरफ्तार, जेल, मुकदमा, जुर्माना, कनेक्शन कट
- **Authority/impersonation:** bank, RBI, SBI/HDFC/ICICI/Axis/PNB, police, CBI, ED, NCB, customs, TRAI, UIDAI, income tax, court, cyber cell, officer, FedEx/DHL, "KYC team" / पुलिस, बैंक, आधार, सीबीआई, कस्टम
- **Greed/reward:** won, winner, lottery, prize, KBC, cashback, refund, guaranteed returns, 5x, double your money, free gift / जीते, इनाम, लॉटरी, रिफंड
- **Isolation:** don't tell anyone, keep confidential, do not disconnect, stay on the call, don't inform family, secret / kisi ko mat batana, call kaat mat, phone band mat karna / किसी को न बताएं, कॉल मत काटिए, गोपनीय
- **False trust:** "official", "verified", "government approved", "dear customer", employee ID/badge numbers, "for your safety"
- **Intent — OTP/credentials:** otp, one time password, verification code, pin, UPI PIN, cvv, password, card number, expiry / ओटीपी, पिन, पासवर्ड, कार्ड नंबर
- **Intent — personal info:** aadhaar, pan, passport, selfie, account number, ifsc, date of birth, KYC update
- **Intent — money:** transfer, send, pay, fee, processing fee, registration fee, deposit, safe account, security deposit, gift card, UPI ID, collect request / जमा करें, ट्रांसफर, फीस, भुगतान
- **Intent — app install:** install, download app, apk, AnyDesk, TeamViewer, QuickSupport, RustDesk, screen share, remote access, 9-digit code / ऐप इंस्टॉल, डाउनलोड
- **Intent — link click:** click, tap, visit, open link, login here, verify here / link par click karein / लिंक पर क्लिक

### 5.3 Category rules (`categories.json`)
Each category = required-any groups + boosters, e.g.:
- *Banking/KYC:* (bank/SBI/KYC/account) + (blocked/suspended/update/verify) (+ link) → high.
- *OTP theft:* (otp/pin/cvv) + (share/send/tell/provide) → high, even without link.
- *Digital-arrest/government impersonation:* (police/CBI/customs/narcotics/parcel/Aadhaar) + (arrest/case/FIR) + (isolation OR payment/"safe account") → critical.
- *Lottery:* (won/winner/lottery/KBC) + (fee/tax/processing/claim) → high.
- *Job:* (part-time/work from home/earn per day) + (registration/deposit/fee/UPI) → high.
- *Investment:* (guaranteed/5x/double/returns/crypto/stock tips) + (group/join/deposit) → medium-high.
- *Delivery:* (parcel/courier/customs/address/package) + (pay ₹/fee/release/link) → medium-high.
- *Utility disconnection:* (electricity/gas/water/SIM/connection) + (disconnected/tonight) + (pay/verify/link) → high. *(Must catch unseen paraphrases like: "Your electricity connection will be disconnected tonight. Pay the verification amount using this link.")*
- *Remote-access:* (install/download) + (AnyDesk/TeamViewer/app/code) + (refund/support/help) → critical.
- Score a category by `Σ matched weights` normalised to 0–100; detect **combinations** (e.g., urgency + money request + link) rather than isolated keywords.

### 5.4 URL / Brand analysis (`UrlAnalyzer`, `BrandImpersonationDetector`)
Parse with a safe URL parser (try/catch, never throw). Compute **registered domain** using bundled `public_suffixes.json` (handle `.co.in`, `.gov.in`, `.org.in`, `.ac.in`, `.nic.in`, `.com`, `.in`, etc.). Points (cap 100):

| Check | Points |
|---|---|
| IP address as host | +40 |
| Punycode/IDN (`xn--`) or mixed-script host | +35 |
| URL shortener (bit.ly, tinyurl, t.co, cutt.ly, rb.gy, is.gd, shorturl.at…) | +25, label "Uncertain — destination not verified" |
| Suspicious TLD (`.xyz .top .click .live .icu .buzz .loan .work .cfd .sbs .rest .monster .support .link .site .online`) | +20 |
| `@` in URL / credentials in URL | +30 |
| ≥4 host labels / deep subdomain nesting | +15 |
| Brand name appears in subdomain or path but registered domain ≠ brand's official domain (`sbi.co.in.attacker.test`) | +45 |
| Lookalike of an official domain (Levenshtein ≤2, or substitutions 0/o, 1/l/i, rn/m, vv/w, hyphen-padding like `sbi-kyc-update`) | +45 |
| Keywords in host/path: login, verify, kyc, update, secure, refund, claim, wallet, reward, otp | +15 |
| ≥3 hyphens / very long URL (>75 chars) / non-standard port | +10 each |
| Direct `.apk` download | +45 |
| Plain `http://` | +10 (**https gives no credit**) |
| Exact match of a registered domain in `brands.json` | cap result at ≤10 → "Lower risk — matches known official domain" (still not a guarantee) |

